WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:03.500
Early in the 27th year of Longwu,

00:03.800 --> 00:06.000
Emperor Xuan, Sikong Yao,

00:06.200 --> 00:09.200
passed away from illness on his journey back south.

00:09.500 --> 00:11.800
In that year,

00:12.000 --> 00:15.200
winter lingered exceedingly late, and spring was exceedingly slow to arrive.
